  <item>
    <title>전기차 충전요금 주말 낮 최대 32% 할인, 언제 어디서 받나요</title>
    <link>https://ai4tenlab.github.io/korea-public-benefit-brief/policy/benefit/transport/2026/09/04/ev-charging-autumn-weekend-discount/</link>
